**Assistant A is closer to a useful answer**, but its implementation has an important functional problem: it appends “See more” after the entire text while also limiting that text to one line. The link can therefore be clipped rather than appearing at the end of the visible line. Also, measuring a `Text` with `numberOfLines={1}` may not reliably reveal that the original text overflowed, since the event may only report the rendered line.

